<title>USA: Spokane, Wash., yields 5.40 pct in 2013.</title>
<headline>Spokane, Wash., yields 5.40 pct in 2013.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it priced $3.325 million of Spokane, Wash., golf system revenue bonds with a top yield of 5.40 percent in 2013.</p>
